quran[6]{c,v,t}:
  7,82,"And his people had no reply except that they said: ‘Drive them out of the town; indeed, they seek the utmost purity!’"
  7,83,"So We delivered him (Lut [Lot]) and his family, except his wife; she was one of those who stayed on in torment."
  7,84,And We rained on them (stones). See then what was the end of the evildoers!
  7,85,"And towards Madyan (We sent) their (kinship) brother Shu‘ayb. He said: ‘O my people, always worship Allah; you have no God except He. Indeed, there has come to you from your Lord a clear sign. So give full measure and weight, and do not decrease whilst giving people their things, nor create mischief in the land after reformation (of the living conditions). This is better for you if you believe (in the divine message)."
  7,86,And do not sit on every path to frighten everyone who has embraced faith in this (call) and to hinder (him) from the path of Allah and to look for any crookedness in this (Message to make him feel frustrated and disgusted with the true Din [Religion]). And remember (Allah’s favour) when you were small in number and He multiplied you. And see what was the end of those who spread mischief and cause disruption!
  7,87,"And if a party amongst you have believed in that (Din [Religion]) which I have been sent with, and some other party have not believed in it, then, (O believers,) have patience till Allah judges between us, and He is the Best of judges."
